Usage: jit [OPTIONS] --binary <BINARY> <COMMAND>

Commands:
  json        Use a local JSON file containing the inputs
  local       Use flag values and local files for inputs
  continuous  Continuously read new inputs from TCP connections
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -b, --binary <BINARY>  Path to the `replay.wasm` binary
      --cranelift        Use Cranelift backend
      --debug            Enable debug output
      --require-success  Require that the validation succeeds
  -h, --help             Print help
